{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e911d6006945d280b499","chatId":"7a82f5ab3c774a3bade1985c7c46b7bd","sessionId":null,"userId":70043,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":921,"promptTokens":1492,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:29"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690324870634893,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e911d6006945d280b498","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369809110,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:29","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e911d6006945d280b498","chatId":"7a82f5ab3c774a3bade1985c7c46b7bd","sessionId":null,"userId":70043,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小奈去学校剧院看学校剧社带来的《狮子王》演出。她并不知道她的好朋友小哈是辛巴的演员，他为了这个角色化了浓妆。表演结束后，小奈作为被选中的观众之一在后台参加演员见面会。她告诉剧组除了辛巴的表演以外，她都很喜欢。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小哈最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 害怕\nB) 开心\nC) 悔恨\nD) 期待\nE) 感激\nF) 尴尬\n\n## 问题 2\n小哈为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他的表演是他的好朋友唯一不喜欢的部分\nB) 娜伊拉并未在他的化妆中认出小哈\nC) 娜伊拉没有机会在后台见到小哈\nD) 小哈的朋友出现并支持他的表演","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690324870634893,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e911d6006945d280b499","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369809107,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:29","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"dd620842e25d41f79bcac0f88249f5e6"}